{"alias":"/safety/restorative/resourcecenter","title":"Culture of Care Resource Center","changed":"2026-09-15T15:51:48+00:00","before":"<p><img alt=\"Culture of Care Banner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"6daee182-6154-4593-b2a3-febaea6cf4db\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/School%20Safety%20-%20Culture%20of%20Care%20Banner%20-%206.10.2026.png\" width=\"100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"rp-masthead text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<p><!-- [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER: MSSC/DOE Logo — upload and replace src] --></p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Creating a Culture of Care in Schools Using Restorative Practices</h1>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- HERO SECTION -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"rp-hero\">\r\n<div class=\"row align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-5 py-2 text-center\"><!-- [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER: Peer-Circle-Hero.png — upload and replace src] --><img alt=\"Students and staff sitting together in a peer circle\" class=\"img-fluid rounded\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/School%20Safety%20-%20Culture%20of%20Care%20Intro%20-%206.1.2026.png\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-7 py-2\">\r\n<p>Welcome to the <em>Creating a Culture of Care in Schools Using Restorative Practices</em> Resource Center — a collection of supplementary materials for educators who have completed the training. Included are additional resources to support schools across Maine as they expand environments of safety and mattering for staff and students, as well as connections to community partners that can help with some of the trickiest challenges.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All materials are currently available as downloadable PDFs. The goal is to continue developing and expanding the resources offered here and to grow a new Community of Practice in Maine. Feedback is important for shaping what is included — please take a moment to share thoughts in the anonymous survey below.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you for all you do for the students of Maine!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dr. Stacey Gulley-Vernon</strong><br />\r\nRestorative Practices Coordinator, Maine School Safety Center</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ============================\r\n     CONTENT PILLARS (CARDS)\r\n     ============================ --><!-- ROW 1: Curriculum + Community Building -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\">\r\n<h2>Restorative Practices Resources</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><!-- [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER: Curriculum.png — upload and replace src] -->\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Curriculum</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"0e74c7b0-47fd-4b85-8436-b0893be7c0ea\" filename=\"School Safety - Restorative Practices PreK Elementary Student Curriculum - 6.4.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Safety%20-%20Restorative%20Practices%20PreK%20Elementary%20Student%20Curriculum%20-%206.4.2026.pdf\">Pre-K–Elementary Student Curriculum for Teachers</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"236e3649-fd3a-4c83-a030-caae1b33af9b\" filename=\"School Safety - Restorative Practices Middle School Curriculum - 6.10.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Safety%20-%20Restorative%20Practices%20Middle%20School%20Curriculum%20-%206.10.2026.pdf\">Middle School Student Curriculum for Teachers</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"1203255b-bd0b-4890-bb52-8ecfd04249aa\" filename=\"School Safety - Restorative Practices High School Student Curriculum - 6.9.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Safety%20-%20Restorative%20Practices%20High%20School%20Student%20Curriculum%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">High School Student Curriculum for Teachers</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f2cf2e3e-ec72-4940-8471-02f2cb052ee6\" filename=\"School Safety - Final School Staff Training Workbook - 4.10.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Safety%20-%20Final%20School%20Staff%20Training%20Workbook%20-%204.10.2026.pdf\">Downloadable CCC Staff Workbooks</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"4dbfa6a2-b40e-45a9-acc8-9e30e0943460\" filename=\"School Safety - Final Implementation Team Training Workbook - 4.16.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Safety%20-%20Final%20Implementation%20Team%20Training%20Workbook%20-%204.16.2026.pdf\">Downloadable CCC IT Workbooks</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><!-- [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER: Community.png — upload and replace src] -->\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Community Building</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"6cc3e0b9-63a7-4c42-9ea0-4a0f8dfad02e\" filename=\"School Safety - PreK-Elementary Mindfulness Activities - 4.10.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Safety%20-%20PreK-Elementary%20Mindfulness%20Activities%20-%204.10.2026.pdf\">Pre-K–Elementary Mindfulness Activities</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"cf4e2df3-8102-47e8-990e-6a387a23a667\" filename=\"School Safety - Middle High Mindfulness Activities - 4.10.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Safety%20-%20Middle%20High%20Mindfulness%20Activities%20-%204.10.2026.pdf\">Middle / High School Mindfulness Activities</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c1c74a14-d69a-4c4a-a84f-9f19b59e4fc2\" filename=\"School Safety - Additional Community Prompts Circle Ideas - 4.10.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Safety%20-%20Additional%20Community%20Prompts%20Circle%20Ideas%20-%204.10.2026.pdf\">110 Circle Questions</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"bbacb692-6e71-4853-a522-e03595672752\" filename=\"School Safety - Integrating Circles into Morning Meeting Responsive Classroom - 9.15.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Safety%20-%20Integrating%20Circles%20into%20Morning%20Meeting%20Responsive%20Classroom%20-%209.15.2026.pdf\">How to Fold the Relational Depth of the Circle Process into the Rhythm of a Responsive Classroom Morning Meeting:&nbsp; One Unified, Restorative Start to Your Day</a></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ROW 2: Behavior + Resources -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><!-- [IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER: Behavior.png — upload and replace src] -->\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Behavior</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\